      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING ZEYATTA (3) turned in a plain effort last time when eighth at Richmond over 320m behind Silvertree Scar (19.02) in a Grade 5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from six starts. Has ability and can bounce back. TAP OUT RUSTY (7) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (30.63) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability to give this a shake. TARA REBEL (1) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at Gosford over 515m behind Mr. Nicko (30.55) in a Grade 5. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Has ability and can measure up. UNPLUG BEN (2) is new to this course but not to be underestimated.",
